<title>USA: Mesquite, Texas, $1.460 mln, won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Mesquite, Texas, $1.460 mln, won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it won $1.460 mill ion of Mesquite, Texas, public property finance limited tax contractual obligations, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.48 percent.</p>
</text>
